// Title: Potential EACore.DLL Sideloading
// Rule ID: edd3ddc3-386f-4ba5-9ada-4376b2cfa7b5
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1574.001
// Category: image_load
